<% content_for :meta_title, "About Doug Morgen, SMB Automation and Rails Consultant" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, "Doug Morgen helps SMBs, founders, and e-commerce teams build practical software, automate operations, connect systems, and ship Rails and Shopify work." %>

<section class="section-block">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="rise-in">
        <p class="pill">About Doug Morgen</p>
        <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">A hands-on software partner for practical businesses.</h1>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700">I am a senior software engineer and former founder who helps SMBs, e-commerce operators, and lean teams automate work and build systems that make the business run better.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">My lane is the useful middle: enough technical leadership to make good decisions, enough hands-on implementation to ship, and enough operator context to care about the business result.</p>

        <div class="mt-7 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <%= link_to "View work", work_path, class: "btn-secondary" %>
          <%= link_to "Connect on LinkedIn", linkedin_url, target: "_blank", rel: "noopener", class: "btn-secondary" %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rise-in">
        <%= render "inquiries/quick_form_cta" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-block pt-0">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">How I work</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Clear scope, direct communication, and steady progress. I like simple systems, explicit tradeoffs, and code that a small team can keep owning.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Where I can help</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">Workflow automation, Rails architecture, Shopify-connected operations, accounting and data migrations, product execution, internal tooling, and API integrations.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Who tends to be a fit</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">SMBs, founders, and e-commerce teams with real operational pain, a willingness to make decisions, and a preference for useful shipped software over ceremony.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">What I am not</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">I am not a slide-deck-only advisor or an agency account layer. If I am involved, I expect the work to get clearer and move.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
